      "purpose": "mechanism",
      "prerequisite": [
        "ch01-s01"
      ],
      "narration": "本章脚号和地址都按 STM32F103C8T6、LQFP48 封装算。C8 是 64 KB 闪存、20 KB SRAM；128 KB 是 F103CB 的容量。闪存从 0x08000000 起，SRAM 从 0x20000000 起，链接脚本里的 LENGTH 就按这两个容量写。",
      "on_screen": [
        "F103C8T6",
        "64 KB / 20 KB"
      ],
      "visual_source": "diagrams/sample-01-swd-vectors.svg",
      "fact_source": [
        "docs/01-开发环境搭建.md#原理与适用范围"
      ],
