    {
      "scene_id": "ch01-s06",
      "title": "CubeMX 必须选 Serial Wire",
      "purpose": "mechanism",
      "prerequisite": [
        "ch01-s01",
        "ch01-s02",
        "ch01-s03",
        "ch01-s04",
        "ch01-s05"
      ],
      "narration": "CubeMX 里 SYS Debug 要选 Serial Wire。选成 No Debug 后，PA13/PA14 会被初始化成普通 GPIO，程序一跑调试口就没了。烧录一次后再也连不上，先按这个顺序救：把 BOOT0 拉高，重新接上探针，再用 CubeProgrammer 连一次。",
      "on_screen": [
        "Serial Wire",
        "No Debug 丢调试口"
      ],
      "visual_source": "animations/boot-sequence.svg",
      "fact_source": [
        "docs/01-开发环境搭建.md#原理与适用范围"
      ],
      "memory_anchor": "调试模式决定引脚",
      "evidence_type": "concept",
      "start": 101.422,
      "duration": 23.966,
      "subtitle_ref": "ch01.srt#06",
      "head": "CubeMX 必须选 Serial Wire",
      "lines": [
        "Serial Wire",
        "No Debug 丢调试口"
      ],
      "say": "CubeMX 里 SYS Debug 要选 Serial Wire。选成 No Debug 后，PA13/PA14 会被初始化成普通 GPIO，程序一跑调试口就没了。烧录一次后再也连不上，先按这个顺序救：把 BOOT0 拉高，重新接上探针，再用 CubeProgrammer 连一次。",
      "svg": "animations/boot-sequence.svg"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "ch01-s07",
      "title": "启动别名",
      "purpose": "mechanism",
      "prerequisite": [
        "ch01-s01",
        "ch01-s02",
        "ch01-s03",
        "ch01-s04",
        "ch01-s05",
        "ch01-s06"
      ],
      "narration": "BOOT0=0 时，CPU 从 0x00000000 读到的是闪存 0x08000000 的别名。第 0 个字是 MSP，第 1 个字是 Reset_Handler。别名意味着两个地址指向同一份物理闪存，程序并没有被搬到别处。",
      "on_screen": [
        "BOOT0=0",
        "0x08000000 别名"
      ],
      "visual_source": "diagrams/sample-00-boot-state.svg",
      "fact_source": [
